  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 300) #13606, eff 5-1-23; ss by #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300); ss by #14137, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 202.03); ss by #14305, eff 8-19-25, EXPIRES: 8-19-35",
